--
libc++ (LLVM 18) <chrono> converts without dropped bodies.  Fixed: the
year_month_day_last members (cpp_member_function_named_like_earlier_used_
class) and, in round 163w, year_month_day.h:212 operator local_days
(cpp11_direct_init_through_explicit_conversion_function).  clang++ 18
-stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
